Column    Description
------    -------------------------------------------
1         Strain
2         Total incremental gain (sum of columns
          4 thru 10
3         Total incremental loss (sum of columns
          11 thru 17
4         Density gain: Burgers vectors [-1  1  1]
                                        [ 1 -1 -1]
5         Density gain: Burgers vectors [ 1 -1  1]
                                        [-1  1 -1]
6         Density gain: Burgers vectors [ 1  1 -1]
                                        [-1 -1  1]
7         Density gain: Burgers vectors [ 1  1  1]
                                        [-1 -1 -1]
8         Density gain: Burgers vectors [ 1  0  0]
                                        [-1  0  0]
9         Density gain: Burgers vectors [ 0  1  0]
                                        [ 0 -1  0]
10        Density gain: Burgers vectors [ 0  0  1]
                                        [ 0  0 -1]
11        Density loss: Burgers vectors [-1  1  1]
                                        [ 1 -1 -1]
12        Density loss: Burgers vectors [ 1 -1  1]
                                        [-1  1 -1]
13        Density loss: Burgers vectors [ 1  1 -1]
                                        [-1 -1  1]
14        Density loss: Burgers vectors [ 1  1  1]
                                        [-1 -1 -1]
15        Density loss: Burgers vectors [ 1  0  0]
                                        [-1  0  0]
16        Density loss: Burgers vectors [ 0  1  0]
                                        [ 0 -1  0]
17        Density loss: Burgers vectors [ 0  0  1]
                                        [ 0  0 -1]
